{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "1141cb12-833e-4132-9752-5163d212c20e",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "6e9df393-cba1-4830-b667-a87bc8d36c89",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3000",
            "content": {
                "en": "Ah—you’re the one from earlier…",
                "zh": "啊，你是之前的......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 134.6666717529297,
            "positionY": 78.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "404bbbb4-7d4d-40fb-a9f8-257e882f6ac4",
                    "targetObjectName": "LevelManager4_7",
                    "targetSceneName": "Level4-7FestivalNoema",
                    "componentTypeName": "LevelManager4_7",
                    "methodName": "DisableNPCTrigger",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "61fdcd3d-4524-479e-aa38-a86b46822bf2",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3001",
            "content": {
                "en": "Hello. I’m Noema’s friend from high school.",
                "zh": "你们好，我是沈梦之高中时的朋友。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 474.6666564941406,
            "positionY": 78.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f4d3b73f-42bf-4aea-beeb-51723043336d",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3002",
            "content": {
                "en": "She said she’d wait for me here. Do you know where she went?",
                "zh": "她之前说会在这里等我，你们知道她去哪里了吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 813.3333740234375,
            "positionY": 78.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6dfcfb75-f535-45cb-b676-468dccf4a5a4",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "1d2aea18-f3ba-4fba-a170-1610e9634968",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3003",
            "content": {
                "en": "Why did you take so long? It’s already been an hour. “Douqiao” is probably halfway through by now, isn’t it?",
                "zh": "你怎么去了这么久？都已经过了一个小时了。“斗巧”都已经进行到一半了吧？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1150.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 78.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e1ae2e5c-159a-4e84-922d-b88de16223be",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "9ea5ff19-c72a-4ce6-9c6b-dfb86c599402",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3004",
            "content": {
                "en": "Yeah. The Sect Master waited for you for a long time.",
                "zh": "是啊，家主刚才等了你好久来着。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1481.333251953125,
            "positionY": 78.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7e3cd0e1-4a49-4528-a6aa-ca9afbb0ba6d",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "1d2aea18-f3ba-4fba-a170-1610e9634968",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3005",
            "content": {
                "en": "The Elysium Troupe’s performance is almost over. Next it’ll be our turn— the Sect Master went over not long ago to get ready.",
                "zh": "极乐戏团那边已经快结束表演了，接下来就轮到我们这边，家主前不久过去准备了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1813.333251953125,
            "positionY": 78.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "44337d00-f706-4f9a-a7e7-0c05dcb781ad",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3006",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Douqiao… I think I’ve heard of it before.)",
                "zh": "（斗巧?之前好像也听说过。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2142.666748046875,
            "positionY": 78.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "5e4f9f89-7f3a-439f-b266-2c358ed7ab63",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "3d251560-306a-4584-8903-bebe74011bfc",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3007",
            "content": {
                "en": "Excuse me—what is “Douqiao”?",
                "zh": "请问“斗巧”指的是？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2472.666748046875,
            "positionY": 78.66667175292969,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e0439474-b6d1-4de0-bc5d-d77b6cc8f735",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "1d2aea18-f3ba-4fba-a170-1610e9634968",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3008",
            "content": {
                "en": "The Sect Master didn’t tell you? Every time the Yuntai Festival comes around, large groups can sign up to join Douqiao. Our local sect participates every year.",
                "zh": "家主没有告诉你吗？每次芸台大会，大型团体都可以报名参与‘斗巧’，我们本地教派每年都会参加。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2802.666748046875,
            "positionY": 78.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "d9f6a1ab-e4c4-43b1-8984-1b965fcb6058",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "1d2aea18-f3ba-4fba-a170-1610e9634968",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3009",
            "content": {
                "en": "Basically, you perform on the stage on the street to the right. Every audience member gets a vote, and whoever gets the most votes can go to Jinlan Pavilion to claim a prize.",
                "zh": "本质上就是去右侧那边街道的戏台上表演，所有观众都有投票权，得票最高者可以去金兰观领取奖品。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3137.33349609375,
            "positionY": 78.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b51ebd32-68b1-4427-893a-1b80f552fca1",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "6e9df393-cba1-4830-b667-a87bc8d36c89",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3010",
            "content": {
                "en": "This year, besides us, those bizarre lunatics from the Elysium Troupe joined too.",
                "zh": "今年除了我们以外，那群极乐戏团的古怪疯子也参加了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3464.666748046875,
            "positionY": 78.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "ae9435ff-7f8a-4246-a6b5-2a7d10fc2f61",
            "index": 11,
            "characterId": "9ea5ff19-c72a-4ce6-9c6b-dfb86c599402",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3011",
            "content": {
                "en": "Shh! Keep your voice down… those people are seriously twisted. And yet something about their presence feels… familiar.",
                "zh": "嘘！小声点......那些家伙邪性的很，身上的气息却总叫人觉着熟悉。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3782.666748046875,
            "positionY": 78.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "84c83655-ad38-47d7-a9f5-a5ca4498645b",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "9ea5ff19-c72a-4ce6-9c6b-dfb86c599402",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3012",
            "content": {
                "en": "If you’re looking for the Sect Master, head right to the stage. You should still catch her just in time for her performance.",
                "zh": "你要找家主，就向右走去戏台那里吧。应该能正好赶上她上台表演。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4101.3330078125,
            "positionY": 78.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0dc2e1d4-4382-48c7-803d-10b768a12c50",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3013",
            "content": {
                "en": "Got it. Thank you so much.",
                "zh": "我知道了，非常感谢。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4432.0,
            "positionY": 78.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "25fb4300-7cca-4ff6-a626-8433e1edbcc4",
            "index": 14,
            "characterId": "6e9df393-cba1-4830-b667-a87bc8d36c89",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3014",
            "content": {
                "en": "Oh—every year’s performance has an interactive part. If you want, you can give it a try.",
                "zh": "对了，每年的表演都有互动内容，你要是想，可以去试试。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4765.3330078125,
            "positionY": 78.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "4ea02f92-71cf-48ad-a455-ed4d1bc1514d",
            "index": 15,
            "characterId": "1d2aea18-f3ba-4fba-a170-1610e9634968",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3015",
            "content": {
                "en": "Have fun!",
                "zh": "祝你玩的开心哦！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5094.0,
            "positionY": 78.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        }
    ],
